# SUKHUM 35 S35-T4 — Full Reconstruction — 30 mL EdP

**Version:** S35-T4 v1, 2026-08-30  
**Status:** `TARGET-LINKED COMPUTATIONAL SUCCESSOR / NOT_COMPOUNDED / NOT_RELEASE_READY`  
**Claim mode:** `HYPOTHESIS_ARM / NOT_RELEASE_READY`  
**Reference contract:** `AVENTUS_ADJACENT_NOT_CLONE`  
